`localSync `- the asset was deleted as a result of the local sync process that compares the state of local and remote assets;
`remoteSync `- when we receive an event indicating that a remote asset was moved to the trash;
`localUser `- when the user decided to delete the local asset in the app. In this case, once the local sync service runs, whatever state diff the asset might have is no longer relevant. The only purpose of recording _localUser_ is to prevent restoring the asset if our algorithm detects that the remote asset exists while the local one is in the trash.

